      "body": "<!-- ccr-slack-attribution -->\n_Requested by **Matt Solomon** · [Slack thread](https://oplabs-pbc.slack.com/archives/C0BHEH8TG91/p1786397033387559)_\n\n## Summary\n\nReproduces https://github.com/futurealisha/superchain-ops/pull/3 here so this repo's CircleCI pipeline (which needs RPC secrets unavailable to fork PRs) actually runs on it. Change is authored by @futurealisha — credit belongs to them.\n\n## For Task PRs\n\n**Task path**: `src/tasks/eth/rehearsals/2026-08-25-R3-nested-upgrade`\n\n## Additional context\n\nThe commit SHA differs from the fork's because that fork is not fetchable from this environment; the file contents are byte-identical.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_011Zz8GVdb1StFmBqVLSgjVh)_",
